    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5760" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būbassus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ăsus</span></b> ), i, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Βύβασσος</span>, Steph., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a town in Caria</i>,
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				5, 28, 29, § 104</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Derivv. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būbassĭus</span></b> ,
				a, um, adj., <i>of
				Bubassus</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sinus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					1, 16, 2</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Būbăsis</span></b> ,
				ĭdis, f.
			adj., <i>of Bubassus</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 9,
				644</span></i>.</div>
